url: "https://github.com/afshinyaghoobi/casper-iiot-cloudsim"
abstract: >-
  Frozen reproducibility package for CASPER, a conformal adaptive scheduling
  framework for robust online dispatch in cloud-edge IIoT. The release preserves
  the E4.6 publication-scale CloudSim Plus campaign metadata, source anchors,
  workflow identifiers, aggregation scripts, and 30-seed result artifacts used
  by the companion FGCS manuscript.
keywords:
